<title>FRANCE: French April industry outlook weak - INSEE.</title>
<headline>French April industry outlook weak - INSEE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics institute INSEE gave the following seasonally-adjusted data.</p>
<p>A positive figure shows the percentage points by which the percentage of respondents saying things had improved or risen outnumbered the percentage saying things had worsened.</p>
<p>					Apr   Mar  Feb  Jan  Dec  Nov Oct</p>
<p> Recent past output		 1    -3    5   -7    3   -2  -8</p>
<p> Finished product stocks	 18    21   20   20   17   18  16</p>
<p> Overall orders and demand    -26   -21  -22  -28  -28  -25 -25</p>
<p> Foreign orders and demand     -2     1    3   -4   -3   -4 -16</p>
<p> Future output (overall)	 -3     0    6    1  -14  -21 -23</p>
<p> Future output (personal)	 9    11    9    4    4    3   3</p>
<p> Future prices (overall)	-13   -13  -11  -13  -21  -25 -31</p>
<p> Future prices (personal)     -12    -7   -4  -22  -19  -15 -11</p>
<p>Recent past output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	    15    23   26   12   25    8   9</p>
<p> Energy			     n/a   n/a  n/a  -86   -4   -7 -75</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	     2     2    2   -2    3   -2  -3</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods		1     5    0  -10   -5   -3 -15</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	14     6    3   14   11   -3   2</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	-31   -39  -28  -37  -47  -44  20</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     3    -3   -2    0   16   10  -2</p>
<p>Future output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	    24    29   16  -12   10    8   7</p>
<p> Energy			     n/a   n/a  n/a  -86    2   -7  61</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	     4     7   13   11    5    4   1</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods	     10     9   13   11    0    5   6</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	21    23   15    9   15    3   6</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	-21   -22   22   19   -8  -29 -30</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     5    10    7    4   -4   10  -2</p>
